@page "/law-practice-demo"

<PageTitle>A law practice's agent · louis-agent</PageTitle>
<PageHead Description="Watch a law practice's website agent answer a question it must not advise on, and book a first consultation instead, recorded once and played back." />

<BusinessDemo Kicker="A law practice" Business="Koringland Attorneys" Title="koringland.example · the agent in the corner" Turns="Conversation"
              Heading="It books the attorney. It never plays one."
              Lede="Someone asks Koringland Attorneys how to change their will after a divorce. The agent doesn't advise. It explains what a first consultation is and books one.">
    <Points>
        <li><strong>It never gives legal advice.</strong> Not what the law says, not what to do. That is the attorney's work.</li>
        <li><strong>It knows the practice.</strong> What it does, its hours, the fee for a first consultation and what to bring.</li>
        <li><strong>It asks before it sends.</strong> The request goes to the practice only after the client says yes.</li>
    </Points>
</BusinessDemo>
